Looking at the current code, I need to apply double buffering to the tile loops so that loading tile k+1 overlaps with computing tile k. I'll create two copies of `l_A` (ping-pong buffers) and alternate between them in both the `tile_loop` (Loop1+Loop2) and `tile_loop4` (Loop4).

